{"flags":[[1000000,0],[1000001,0],[1000002,0],[1000003,0],[1000004,0],[1000005,0],[1000006,0],[1000007,0],[1000008,0],[1000009,0],[1000010,0],[1000011,0],[1000012,0],[1000013,0],[1000014,0],[1000015,-1],[1000016,0],[1000017,100],[1000018,0],[1000019,1500],[1000020,0],[1000021,0],[1000022,1],[1000023,1000000],[1000024,0],[1000025,100],[1000026,200],[1000027,2],[1000028,1100001],[1000029,4],[1000030,99000000],[1000031,4],[1000032,99000001],[1000033,2],[1000034,1100002],[1000035,2],[1000036,1100000],[1000037,0],[1000038,90000000],[1000039,0],[1000040,0],[1000041,34],[1000042,35],[1000043,36],[1000044,31],[1000045,32],[1000046,33],[1000047,27],[1000048,28],[1000049,38],[1000050,39],[1000051,3],[1000052,25],[1000053,26],[1000054,30],[1000055,37],[1000056,10],[1000057,40],[1000058,41],[1000059,42],[1000060,43],[1000061,24],[1000062,65],[1000063,66],[1000064,53],[1000065,80]],"messages":{"1000000":"Thank you for coming. I am Ostare, the commander of this area.\nAs you see, this town has fallen into a terrible state.\n \nI can't sleep peacefully because goblins and demons are\nlingering around the protective wall.\n","1000001":"These days, the army doesn't have enough money to send troops here,\nand it's just a matter of time before this town falls to the enemy.\nMost residents have escaped to neighboring towns, and only merchants\nand holy spirit witches have remained.\n \nThat means we have to fight against our enemies\nwith only our small number of troops.\n","1000002":"I want you to destroy the Goblins around this town.\nThere's a lot of them, but they are very unorganized.\nJust think of it as a warm-up.\n","1000003":"Well, this is the equipment supplied by the army.\nEven you cannot fight against them without any equipment, can you?\n \nIn addition, some money was provided for you.\nWe know it's not much, but the army doesn't have much to give.\nPlease manage on this budget.\n \nOh, you cannot use the equipment\nunless you equip yourself using the Item Screen.\n","1000004":"As soon as I get new information, I will let you know.\nPlease visit me when you can...I'm always here.\n","1000005":"There is no new information so far.\nDo your best to accomplish the duties you've been given.\n","1000006":"If you had what it takes to become a Warrior,\nI'd give you new duties.\n","1000007":"There is new information from a soldier who's been at the Dusty Ruins\nfar to the northwest.  It seems Goblins from this area have been actively\ntaking over the ruins as their base.\n","1000008":"Thanks to your help, we can handle the situation here for a while.\nYou rush to the ruins and destroy the main culprits.  Please go now!\n","1000009":"There is a Warp Gate near the ruins.\nTry to make the most of this opportunity.\n","1000010":"I know you'll succeed.\n","1000011":"Well done!  This town is finally free from danger.\n \nThis is a reward for your efforts. Take it. You've earned it!\n","1000012":"Monsters are attacking Cold Svalt Town.\nHead over there.  You must pass through the Wasteland of Pillars\nto the west to find Cold Svalt.\n","1000013":"Hello. Oh, it's you.\nCan I help you?\n \n \u30fb~Trade                 ~\n \u30fb~Identify Items        ~\n \u30fb~Repair Items          ~\n \n                   ~QUIT~\n","1000014":" \u30fb~Arms               %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Head Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Body Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Shield             %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Leg Armor          %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~All Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Non-Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n                           ~QUIT~\n","1000015":"You're running short of money.\n","1000016":"It has been repaired\n","1000017":"It costs %d in gold to identify items.\n \n                  ~YES~  ~NO~\n","1000018":"All items have been identified.\n","1000019":"Recently, the Goblins have become violent.\nNew species which I've never seen before have started emerging...\nWhat on earth is going on?\nI'm losing my business!\n","1000020":"I'm in a bad mood now!\nDo not talk to me!\n","1000021":"I heard the news!\nYou defeated the Red Goblin to the northeast of the town!?\nYou're different from the cowards in the past!\n \n.......\n","1000022":"I like you!!\n","1000023":"Oh, I forgot to tell you my name.\nMy name is Malse, Merchant Malse.\n \nIf you need something, tell me.\nI will sell you items for very reasonable prices.\n","1000024":"Excuse me for asking, but\nI had a gem snatched away by Black Hammer\nin the far southwest area of the town.\n \nCould you get it back for me?\n","1000025":"You drove away the Goblins that established themselves\nin the West Ruins.  Just as we expected, you're great!\n","1000026":"I heard that you're going to Cold Svalt.\nI wish you could stay here all the time.\n","1000027":"My brother runs his business there.\nI'll tell him about you, so stop by and say hi.\nHere is a gift for you.\nTake it.\n","1000028":"Oh, here you are. That must be the stolen gem!!\nDid you get it back for me?\n","1000029":".......\n","1000030":"I'm sure this is the stolen gem.\nThank you !!\nI'll teach you something important in return.\n","1000031":"There is a strange guy who runs a business in the inner part of the\nWasteland of Pillars. He did his business in this town a long time\nago, but he was exiled from the town because of his crooked dealings.\n \nIf you have a chance to go there, stop by his place.\nI'll tell him about you.\n","1000032":"You came to run an errand for Gedo?\n","1000033":".......\n","1000034":"Well, it's not that important, but\nplease try and pass it on to Gedo.\n","1000035":"It seems you don't need any of the equipment\nyou can get around here.\n","1000036":"But you need medicines and mines.\nLet's deal with tools mainly from now on.\n","1000037":"The Holy Spirit presides over life!\nHeal the evil wounds!\n","1000038":"May the grace of God be with you.\n","1000039":"I feel a strong light in your body.\nHave more confidence in yourself and do your best.\n","1000040":"Are you the new warrior that was hired recently?\nI am the Holy Spirit Witch, Syria.\n \nPlease visit me any time,\nand I'll help restore your mental and physical strength.\n \n....\n","1000041":"There are monsters tormenting us to the northeast of this town.\nAn old merchant also had a bitter experience.\n \nCan you do us a favor and destroy those monsters?\n","1000042":"It seems this town can finally recover because of you.\nThank you very much.\n","1000043":"I heard that you might go to Cold Svalt.\nTake this with you as it will be useful.\n","1000044":"I had an important Spirit Stone stolen by Goblins at the ruins\nthe other day.  I'm sorry, I can't cure you without it.\n","1000045":"!! Is that the stolen Spirit Stone?\nDid you get it back?  Thank you very much.\n","1000046":"As a token of my gratitude, please accept this humble gift.\nIt may be helpful.\n","1000047":"Kerberos\n \n ~Check Status~ \n ~Explanation~\n ~Swap Dogs~\n \n        ~QUIT~\n","1000048":"The more we fight together, the stronger we'll become.\n","1000049":"We each have individual skills that we are good at.\nYou should find a companion that best suits you.\n","1000050":"Gravity\n \n ~Check Status~ \n ~Explanation~\n ~Swap Dogs~\n \n         ~QUIT~\n","1000051":"By pressing TAB+Left Click, we jump and kick enemies.\nWe can also flip switches or press buttons.\n","1000052":"You can give us an attack command by pressing the Spacebar.\nIf you press it again, you give us an evacuation order.\n","1000053":"Dune\n \n ~Check Status~ \n ~Explanation~\n ~Swap Dogs~\n \n         ~QUIT~\n","1000054":"Meat is our favorite food.\nOur HP is restored if you give it to us.\n","1000055":"If you give us better quality meat, more of our HP is restored.\n","1000056":"Harley\n \n ~Check Status~ \n ~Explanation~\n ~Swap Dogs~\n \n         ~QUIT~\n","1000057":"You found me finally.\n","1000058":"I wish my owner was a woman.\n","1000059":"Remote Town\n","1000060":"Remote Town\n"},"status":[[0,7,4294967295,0],[0,0,12000000,4],[0,1,12000000,17],[0